# deploy/.env is generated — do not copy this file as-is.
#
#   ./scripts/local-compose-env.sh      # `just run-compose` runs it for you
#
# Non-secret defaults live in deploy/compose.env (committed).
# The one secret, POSTGRES_PASSWORD, is generated locally on first run and then
# kept — it is never fetched from, or stored in, a secret store (#400). Delete
# deploy/.env together with the DB volume to start the local database over.
# (The OIDC client is public + PKCE since #274 — there is no client secret.)
#
# Deployed environments do not use this file: the Woodpecker deploy step renders
# its configuration from sovereign-config — see docs/DEPLOY.md.
